{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"liusima-e-o238","title":"太祖教有谏者死，贾逵建谏草与三主簿署名入白","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-f3c820283b8b11bea4db","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"太祖教有谏者死，贾逵建谏草与三主簿署名入白","evidence":["liusima-q-600ace6f2a26186a1001"]},{"id":"liusima-a-5f971d4d8206df284821","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"白事后太祖收逵等，逵自认造意诣狱","evidence":["liusima-q-b4781ea5ee1b29f2fdd3"]},{"id":"liusima-a-53e511df8b3e2bbdadae","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"贾逵促狱吏着械，太祖遣人察之，教原复其职","evidence":["liusima-q-3221b78ef2c716299918"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"欲征吴而大霖雨，三军多不愿行，恐外有谏者，教曰今孤戒严未知所之，有谏者死；怒，收逵等，当送狱取造意者；果遣家中人就狱视逵，既而教曰逵无恶意，原复其职","evidence":["liusima-q-600ace6f2a26186a1001","liusima-q-b4781ea5ee1b29f2fdd3","liusima-q-3221b78ef2c716299918"]},{"person":"identity-six-20261024-p-jia-kui-liangdao","role":"受教，谓同僚三主簿今实不可出而教如此，不可不谏，乃建谏草以示三人；即言我造意，遂走诣狱；谓狱吏曰促械我，尊者且疑我在近职求缓于卿，今将遣人来察我；著械适讫","evidence":["liusima-q-600ace6f2a26186a1001","liusima-q-b4781ea5ee1b29f2fdd3","liusima-q-3221b78ef2c716299918"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-600ace6f2a26186a1001","liusima-q-b4781ea5ee1b29f2fdd3","liusima-q-3221b78ef2c716299918"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-600ace6f2a26186a1001","source_order":[15,255,10],"order":3351}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"identity-six-20261024-p-jia-kui-liangdao","name":"贾逵（字梁道）","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-3221b78ef2c716299918","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-b1e12de11e0a0c295596","layer":"pei","quote":"狱吏以逵主簿也，不即著械。谓狱吏曰：‘促械我！尊者且疑我在近职，求缓于卿，今将遣人来察我。’逵著械适讫，而太祖果遣家中人，就狱视逵。既而教曰：‘逵无恶意，原复其职","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":254,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bbb6afbe1c2e33821ec0","start":147,"end":228,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-600ace6f2a26186a1001","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-b1e12de11e0a0c295596","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖欲征吴而大霖雨，三军多不愿行。太祖知其然，恐外有谏者，教曰：‘今孤戒严，未知所之。有谏者，死！’逵受教，谓其同僚三主簿曰：‘今实不可出，而教如此；不可不谏也。’乃建谏草，以示三人；三人不获已，皆署名","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":254,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bbb6afbe1c2e33821ec0","start":10,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-b4781ea5ee1b29f2fdd3","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-b1e12de11e0a0c295596","layer":"pei","quote":"入白事，太祖怒，收逵等。当送狱，取造意者，逵即言‘我造意’，遂走诣狱","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":254,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bbb6afbe1c2e33821ec0","start":112,"end":146,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
